/T (A strategic economic outlook designed to translate today's market conditions into practical business decisions. This session will examine key indicators, including interest rates, lending trends, consumer behavior, labor markets, and industry shifts, and what they mean for business growth, pricing, hiring, and capital planning. Attendees will gain actionable insights into how national and global economic trends impact Memphis businesses and how to position their companies for stability, investment, and long-term growth.)
/E (A strategic economic outlook designed to translate today's market conditions into practical business decisions. This session will examine key indicators, including interest rates, lending trends, consumer behavior, labor markets, and industry shifts, and what they mean for business growth, pricing, hiring, and capital planning. Attendees will gain actionable insights into how national and global economic trends impact Memphis businesses and how to position their companies for stability, investment, and long-term growth.)
