/P 250 0 R
/T (A strategic examination of the funding sources available to entrepreneurs and growth-stage businesses. This session explores how successful companies leverage grants, debt financing, equity investments, contracts, and alternative funding tools to support business objectives at every stage of growth. Attendees will gain practical insight into capital readiness, funding strategy, and how to align the right type of capital with the right business need. The session will help entrepreneurs move beyond constantly chasing the next funding opportunity and toward developing a capital strategy aligned with their long-term business goals.)
